  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">AuthorAID is a global research community that provides networking, mentoring, resources and training for researchers in developing countries. From 2010 it is an integrated part of the core support to International Network for the Availability of Scientific Publications (INASP).</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">AuthorAID &#xE4;r en global plattform som ger forskare fr&#xE5;n utvecklingsl&#xE4;nder tillg&#xE5;ng till n&#xE4;tverk, mentorskap i skrivprocessen av vetenskapliga artiklar. Fr&#xE5;n och med 2010 &#xE4;r st&#xF6;det till AuthorAID en integrerad del av k&#xE4;rnst&#xF6;det till International Network for the Availability of Scientific Publications (INASP)</narrative>
  </description>
